## Security Baseline

- Never store secrets in code, config files, or chat messages
- Use environment variables for credentials (sourced from `.env` files that are gitignored)
- Validate all external input at system boundaries
- Use parameterized queries (never string-concatenate SQL)
- Apply least privilege to all service accounts and API tokens
- Log security-relevant events (auth failures, permission denials, input validation failures)

